    <div class="faq-list">
      <div class="faq-item open">
        <div class="faq-q" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">What exactly is pharma proxy job support?<div class="faq-tog"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"/></svg></div></div>
        <div class="faq-a">Pharma proxy job support means having an expert pharma professional work alongside you — behind the scenes — while you handle your actual job deliverables. For professionals stuck on complex clinical, regulatory, validation, or analytical tasks, it provides real-time guidance to complete work correctly, meet deadlines, and grow domain knowledge. We work via WhatsApp, call, or screen share — whatever suits you best.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item">
        <div class="faq-q" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">How does pharma interview proxy support work?<div class="faq-tog"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"/></svg></div></div>
