        <div class="faq-q" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">Which pharma domains do you cover?<div class="faq-tog"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"/></svg></div></div>
